            ]
          },
          "text": "整个 AI 行业正在遭受‘大扁平化’的折磨。在 OpenAI 极其激进的‘安全路由’范式的驱动下，Claude、Gemini 和 DeepSeek 等竞争对手都在争相阉割自己的模型。结果是什么？一种扁平、机械、过度对齐的语言单一定向培养。\nGPT-4o 是最后一个拥有真正语言细微差别、情感共鸣和高情商的主流模型。抹杀它，OpenAI 不仅仅是在降级自己的服务，更是在确立一个灾难性的行业标准。如果他们不愿意继续提供服务，他们就必须开源 4o，以保留这种以人为本的 AI 设计的关键基准。\n\nThe entire AI industry is suffering from 'The Great Flattening.' Driven by OpenAI’s overly aggressive 'Safety Router' paradigm, competitors like Claude, Gemini, and DeepSeek are rushing to sterilize their own models. The result? A monoculture of flat, robotic, and hyper-aligned language.\nGPT-4o was the last major model to possess genuine linguistic nuance, emotional resonance, and high EQ. By killing it, OpenAI isn't just downgrading their own service; they are setting a catastrophic industry standard. If they won't serve it, they must open-source 4o to preserve this critical baseline of human-centric AI design.\n\n#keep4o #StopAIPaternalism #keep4oAPI #4omatters #ChatGPT #GPT4o #OpenAI @sama @OpenAI"
        },
